The '''Southfury River''' is likely [[Kalimdor]]'s most prominent river. Beginning as a small stream in the highlands surrounding [[Mount Hyjal]], it grows into a wide, swift-flowing river that forms the boundary between [[Ashenvale]] Forest and [[Azshara]], and further south, the border between the [[Barrens]] and [[Durotar]] where nasty creatures known as [[crocolisk|crocolisks]] patrol the waters. The river empties into the [[Great Sea]] in a cascading waterfall just northeast of the [[goblin]] port town of [[Ratchet]].

