[[File:Southsea Sandbar.png|thumb|right|300px]]
The '''Southsea Sandbar''' is an island located within [[Gillijim's Isle]] to the west of the main isle. It is the main basecamp for the [[Southsea Freebooters]] on Gillijim and [[Lapidis Isle]]. The southern-most island of the sandbar is [[Distillery Island]], where the Southsea Pirates distill their Southsea Reserve moonshine.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|51|Southsea Reserve}}</ref>

