'''Starshard Cradle''' is the site of an arcane meteor that crashed into [[Moonwhisper Coast]] that was called down by the [[Blue dragonflight]].<ref>[https://discord.com/channels/466622455805378571/895751435797536788/1496783160149540866 Moriena from the Turtle WoW Community Discord] - "its a meteor called down by the blue dragons"</ref> After the meteor fell, a brood of the azure flight led by the drake [[Starcaller]] began to occupy the impact site, driving away anything that comes too close - adventurers, scholars and even the naga have learned to give it a wide berth.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|58+|A Star That Calls Back}}</ref> When the meteor fell from the skies, part of the nearby [[Servitor's Sanctuary]] was also caught in the blast,<ref>[[Writings of the Elder]]</ref> but the [[Fallen Ones]] yet managed to recover meteor shards for their own.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|55+|Heaven Falling Down}}</ref>

